pk-p4-features done — 2026-07-29

## Feature 1: KOT Diff Algorithm
- Added `generateKOTsForOrder(orderId, branchId)` to KitchenService
  - Batch-checks existing KOTItems to skip already-KOT'd items (idempotent)
  - Groups new items by MenuItem.departmentId, creates one KOTTicket per dept group
  - Emits `kot.created` socket event per ticket
- KitchenModule now exports KitchenService
- OrdersModule imports KitchenModule
- OrdersService injects KitchenService
  - Calls generateKOTsForOrder (non-blocking) after createOrder
  - Calls generateKOTsForOrder (non-blocking) when status → CONFIRMED

## Feature 2: Table Merge
- Added `mergeTables(primaryOrderId, secondaryOrderId, restaurantId)` to TablesService
  - Moves all secondary items to primary in a transaction
  - Recalculates primary order totals
  - Cancels secondary order, frees secondary table (status → AVAILABLE)
  - Emits `order.merged` socket event
- Added POST /tables/merge controller endpoint
- Frontend: MergeTablesModal added to orders/page.tsx
  - "Merge Tables" button in header
  - Two dropdowns: primary (keep) + secondary (merge from)
  - Refreshes on success

## Feature 3: Reservations Module
- Schema: Added Reservation model + ReservationStatus enum
  - Back-relations added to Restaurant, Branch, Table
  - Migration: 20260728211912_add_reservations applied
- API: Full CRUD module (reservations.service/controller/module/dto)
  - GET /reservations?branchId=&date=&status=
  - GET /reservations/:id
  - POST /reservations
  - PATCH /reservations/:id (emits reservation.seated on status → SEATED)
  - DELETE /reservations/:id
  - Registered in AppModule
- Frontend: /reservations page with date picker, status tabs, card grid
  - AddReservationModal with branch/table/datetime/partySize fields
  - Per-card actions: Seat Now, No Show, Cancel, Mark Completed, Delete
  - Reservations link added to sidebar (CalendarDays icon, between Shifts and Customers)

## Bonus
- Created apps/admin/src/app/not-found.tsx (required by Next.js 15, was missing)

Both `bun run build` pass with 0 errors.
